== Port Haven Casino ==

[[File:DQ6 Casino Counter.png|right]]

You may have noticed by now that the DS version is easier than the SNES version.  We now see one of the biggest reasons why.

This place is not worth anything in the SNES version.  The slot machines only take 5 tokens at a time, and will only accept horizontal matches in the middle column.  Even a 777 will only net 1500 Coins.  Here are the prizes available, for an idea of how terrible that is... 

{| {{prettytable|notwide=1}}
|-
! Item || Price || Description
|-
| Magic Water
| 200 Coins
| Restores 40-50 MP when used out-of-battle, and 10-15 MP when used in-battle.
|-
