== Enchanted Armour ==

[[File:DQ6 DS - Enchanted Armour.png|right]]

With all that done, you can also get the twelfth strongest armour in the game, at Weaver's Peak.  Milly can't wear the Platinum Mail, but she CAN equip the Enchanted Armour, which reduces all direct-damage spells by 10 points.  

Of course, it's not convenient to get right now.  You'd have to warp to the Alltrade Ruins, go into the Dream World, warp to the Weaver's Peak weapon shop, warp to Somnia, then walk ''all'' the way back through the Cave to Alltrades before you finally get back to Port Haven.  It's more convenient to instead wait until after Moonmirror Tower, since you're required to go back to the Dream World after completing it.

